Done. `Client.send()` and `AsyncClient.send()` now apply the client's configured timeout to a raw `Request` when it has no `timeout` extension, via a new `BaseClient._set_timeout()` helper (`httpx/_client.py:569`). Added sync and async regression tests in `tests/test_timeouts.py`; both pass.
